    <item>
      <title>Buckshot 0.5 (build 215)</title>
      <pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 05:23:45 -0700</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>215</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Files and your message now arrive together on iMessage, with upload progress while it sends. Click a person in the To field to add them to Contacts or edit them right there. New send-outs are titled “New Send-Out” until you type a message or subject. Scheduled send-outs go out on time with a closed, plugged-in Mac and wait for the files to finish uploading; laptops get a clear reminder to stay plugged in. Search in the import windows, and the message preview now matches the iMessage or Email tab you&#x27;re on.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/rockyshootingstar/buckshot-site/releases/download/v0.5-215/Buckshot-0.5-215.zip" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="DvvNEK7VmJdQFMOWhO8+p9yKon2DXoANlygrOj8dVLCczUv7tKxFVet0muvyJbbQRZkddGxj9CDL5Ei2RcNXBA==" length="9012679" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Buckshot 0.5 (build 204)</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 09:11:11 -0700</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>204</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Wake my Mac no longer asks for your password: allow Buckshot once in System Settings ▸ Login Items and scheduled send-outs wake your Mac and go out on time. Also: a calmer {name} heads-up, Hide/Show for a send-out&#x27;s Stats, “Opened (x3)” counts, Export saves just the selected list, and search in the import windows.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/rockyshootingstar/buckshot-site/releases/download/v0.5-204/Buckshot-0.5-204.zip" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="xgezAsgOV+tEqj9qQyKuVKvyk/TylFYcF2CSIbmooeeAEDR3+bBaDduHp4fz7jUxvRnAHWjP1NtMW38qUxAXAQ==" length="8879103" />
